The user is asking me to call the StructuredOutput tool to complete this request. Looking at the StructuredOutput tool definition:

```json
{
  "name": "StructuredOutput",
  "description": "return the final response as structured JSON",
  "parameters": {
    "properties": {
      "markers": {
        "description": "What list_markers returned",
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    "required": ["markers"],
    "type": "object"
  }
}
```

So I need to call this with the markers parameter set to what list_markers returned, which was "allow-path.txt".
